Walter Stoke is an elderly, blind human priest whose heavy, layered vestments are woven from translucent, prismatic glass fibers that catch and scatter the light.

Walter is a member of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], and among its people aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] he directs some fifteen of middle to high rank. He is friendly and practiced in politics. The church keeps its fane, a temple to the Host, and the church is more practiced than any other Org at making a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]]. Walter was not seeking an ally when the Party called.
